<title>USA: Disney's Ovitz received $38.9 million.</title>
<headline>Disney's Ovitz received $38.9 million.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Michael Ovitz, former president of Walt Disney Co, was paid $38.9 million as part of a severance package with the entertainment giant when he resigned December 27, Walt Disney said Thursday.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, Disney also said Ovitz's stock option for three million common shares vested and became exercisable under his employment contract with the company upon his resignation.</p>
